<title>SWEDEN: Swedish retail sales fall 0.2 pct in April.</title>
<headline>Swedish retail sales fall 0.2 pct in April.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish retail sales fell 0.2 percent in April compared to March, Statistics Sweden said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    (Percentage change)	   April 97   year to date</p>
<p>    Retail sales		    +4.4	 +3.9</p>
<p>    - in non-specialised stores +0.6	 +1.3</p>
<p>    - in specialised stores     +9.2	 +7.5</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
</text>
